{"char_offset": [6472, 6682], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:24Z", "heading_path": ["Influenza (seasonal)", "Treatment"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 41, "paragraph_text": "The WHO Global Influenza Surveillance and Response System (GISRS) monitors resistance to antivirals among circulating influenza viruses to provide timely evidence for national policies related to antiviral use.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Influenza (seasonal) > Treatment > p[41]", "sha256_of_page": "4ccdfce9f34438558f46c2d3fd53c441529a154dd83b98f3ba46a71d756631af", "sha256_of_paragraph": "49ead373886c8c6d77911447b576ffee2fe8bf6a875670ed818fe30681f663c1", "source_id": "WHO-FLU", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/influenza-(seasonal)"}
{"char_offset": [6683, 6732], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:24Z", "heading_path": ["Influenza (seasonal)", "Prevention"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 42, "paragraph_text": "Vaccination is the best way to prevent influenza.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Influenza (seasonal) > Prevention > p[42]", "sha256_of_page": "4ccdfce9f34438558f46c2d3fd53c441529a154dd83b98f3ba46a71d756631af", "sha256_of_paragraph": "fd6967e7f185b1d5c42154907db24eacc62ace1da98b9bfab1d658260f1effd0", "source_id": "WHO-FLU", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/influenza-(seasonal)"}
{"char_offset": [6733, 6912], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:24Z", "heading_path": ["Influenza (seasonal)", "Prevention"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 43, "paragraph_text": "Safe and effective vaccines have been used for more than 60 years. Immunity from vaccination goes away over time so annual vaccination is recommended to protect against influenza.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Influenza (seasonal) > Prevention > p[43]", "sha256_of_page": "4ccdfce9f34438558f46c2d3fd53c441529a154dd83b98f3ba46a71d756631af", "sha256_of_paragraph": "3e8da85a14488721987689bb1c2052059ef365fb0bd46042b5fd66c05d26b260", "source_id": "WHO-FLU", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/influenza-(seasonal)"}
{"char_offset": [6913, 7055], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:24Z", "heading_path": ["Influenza (seasonal)", "Prevention"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 44, "paragraph_text": "The vaccine may be less effective in older people, but it will make the illness less severe and reduces the chance of complications and death.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Influenza (seasonal) > Prevention > p[44]", "sha256_of_page": "4ccdfce9f34438558f46c2d3fd53c441529a154dd83b98f3ba46a71d756631af", "sha256_of_paragraph": "a72cd127f4704947399d53e1853e26e8be91b1fe299bcb846595b71c1cc02b5b", "source_id": "WHO-FLU", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/influenza-(seasonal)"}
