{"char_offset": [0, 120], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:26Z", "heading_path": ["关于流感疫苗的五个误区"], "language": "zh", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 0, "paragraph_text": "事实：每年有多达65万人死于流感。这仅包括因呼吸道症状造成的死亡，因此可能的影响甚至更高。即使是健康的人也可以感染流感，但免疫系统脆弱的人尤其容易染病。大多数人会在几周内康复，但有些人会出现并发症，包括鼻窦和耳部感染、肺炎、心脏或脑部炎症。", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "关于流感疫苗的五个误区 > p[0]", "sha256_of_page": "438d57207402d7f165c269fc90866bd6cfff929bd71b2cbac8970f1cca9d5fc9", "sha256_of_paragraph": "5cf5a20c1741bc50a623951be1b65c2049f76217bcd9ed267d2147265e0a840d", "source_id": "WHO-FLU-5M", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/zh/news-room/spotlight/influenza-are-we-ready/5-myths-about-the-flu-vaccine"}
{"char_offset": [121, 182], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:26Z", "heading_path": ["关于流感疫苗的五个误区"], "language": "zh", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 1, "paragraph_text": "事实：流感疫苗含有一种不可能传播流感的灭活病毒。如果你感觉疼痛或轻微发烧，这是免疫系统对疫苗的正常反应，通常仅持续一两天。", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "关于流感疫苗的五个误区 > p[1]", "sha256_of_page": "438d57207402d7f165c269fc90866bd6cfff929bd71b2cbac8970f1cca9d5fc9", "sha256_of_paragraph": "aa06d33c1859e95006d07767e8b28cd714e93002aadcf4ae8627b571adba57ed", "source_id": "WHO-FLU-5M", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/zh/news-room/spotlight/influenza-are-we-ready/5-myths-about-the-flu-vaccine"}
{"char_offset": [183, 246], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:26Z", "heading_path": ["关于流感疫苗的五个误区"], "language": "zh", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 2, "paragraph_text": "事实：已证明流感疫苗是安全的。严重的副作用极为罕见。每百万人中才有一人可能患上吉兰-巴雷综合征（GBS），导致肌肉无力和瘫痪。", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "关于流感疫苗的五个误区 > p[2]", "sha256_of_page": "438d57207402d7f165c269fc90866bd6cfff929bd71b2cbac8970f1cca9d5fc9", "sha256_of_paragraph": "78ff1ee82c2bf39f9a805fee6a90fefae14904cbdb59ff8f166c3ea40a039828", "source_id": "WHO-FLU-5M", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/zh/news-room/spotlight/influenza-are-we-ready/5-myths-about-the-flu-vaccine"}
{"char_offset": [247, 346], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:26Z", "heading_path": ["关于流感疫苗的五个误区"], "language": "zh", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 3, "paragraph_text": "事实：若干流感病毒一直在传播。虽然人们接种了疫苗，但可能仍然会感染流感，这是因为感染毒株没有包括在疫苗之内。然而，接种疫苗可以提高面临流感获得保护的机会。这对于阻止病毒影响免疫系统薄弱的人尤为重要。", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "关于流感疫苗的五个误区 > p[3]", "sha256_of_page": "438d57207402d7f165c269fc90866bd6cfff929bd71b2cbac8970f1cca9d5fc9", "sha256_of_paragraph": "8de3c478d1295bc430e0b3abc748c367391b16fdd7edea96e4721f90c83d8c87", "source_id": "WHO-FLU-5M", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/zh/news-room/spotlight/influenza-are-we-ready/5-myths-about-the-flu-vaccine"}
{"char_offset": [347, 398], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:26Z", "heading_path": ["关于流感疫苗的五个误区"], "language": "zh", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 4, "paragraph_text": "事实：孕妇尤其应该接种流感疫苗，因为她们的免疫系统比平常弱。在怀孕的任何阶段，灭活流感疫苗都是安全的。", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "关于流感疫苗的五个误区 > p[4]", "sha256_of_page": "438d57207402d7f165c269fc90866bd6cfff929bd71b2cbac8970f1cca9d5fc9", "sha256_of_paragraph": "34e7a24e166f274eed24ba9fca5045768eaa5b8d798002dd85172eb637fccc58", "source_id": "WHO-FLU-5M", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/zh/news-room/spotlight/influenza-are-we-ready/5-myths-about-the-flu-vaccine"}
