{"char_offset": [5865, 5980], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:35Z", "heading_path": ["Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19)", "Wear a mask properly"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 117, "paragraph_text": "Clean your hands before you put your mask on, before and after you take it off, and after you touch it at any time.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19) > Wear a mask properly > p[117]", "sha256_of_page": "f8a274d7c5e37c6c7cd3a7644696c426a3b9cea772dde4a3f7f9aad7548a2f71", "sha256_of_paragraph": "bec0794e4c367976c8f14284603b880c59d23aa272e593d74e2075b7e5362819", "source_id": "WHO-PUB", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public"}
{"char_offset": [5981, 6149], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:35Z", "heading_path": ["Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19)", "Wear a mask properly"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 118, "paragraph_text": "When you take off your mask, store it in a clean plastic bag, and every day either wash it if it’s a fabric mask or dispose of it in a trash bin if it’s a medical mask.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19) > Wear a mask properly > p[118]", "sha256_of_page": "f8a274d7c5e37c6c7cd3a7644696c426a3b9cea772dde4a3f7f9aad7548a2f71", "sha256_of_paragraph": "8cf87117dec44df6f48253093a53b7b474a9ee386f2ba67bcbf629de6d1d3350", "source_id": "WHO-PUB", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public"}
{"char_offset": [6150, 6196], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:35Z", "heading_path": ["Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19)", "Wear a mask properly"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 119, "paragraph_text": "Questions and answers about children and masks", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19) > Wear a mask properly > p[119]", "sha256_of_page": "f8a274d7c5e37c6c7cd3a7644696c426a3b9cea772dde4a3f7f9aad7548a2f71", "sha256_of_paragraph": "cfa931418935815f1c6f6f273cd0ca5ed7022a7ce53df3b0b58808c794c01c09", "source_id": "WHO-PUB", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public"}
{"char_offset": [6197, 6244], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:35Z", "heading_path": ["Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19)", "Wear a mask properly"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 120, "paragraph_text": "Guidance for decision makers and health workers", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19) > Wear a mask properly > p[120]", "sha256_of_page": "f8a274d7c5e37c6c7cd3a7644696c426a3b9cea772dde4a3f7f9aad7548a2f71", "sha256_of_paragraph": "a84636652395c04358da88119eb584295751189bff093b449b27e4fc62622475", "source_id": "WHO-PUB", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public"}
{"char_offset": [6245, 6409], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:35Z", "heading_path": ["Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19)", "Wear a mask properly"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 121, "paragraph_text": "The risks of getting COVID-19 are higher in crowded and inadequately ventilated spaces where infected people spend long periods of time together in close proximity.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19) > Wear a mask properly > p[121]", "sha256_of_page": "f8a274d7c5e37c6c7cd3a7644696c426a3b9cea772dde4a3f7f9aad7548a2f71", "sha256_of_paragraph": "2b5aa22ceaf4bdcd6c10bdb4f3b10b9ca222236891f88013a6e51b6cae34365c", "source_id": "WHO-PUB", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public"}
{"char_offset": [6410, 6664], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:35Z", "heading_path": ["Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19)", "Wear a mask properly"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 122, "paragraph_text": "Outbreaks have been reported in places where people have gather, often in crowded indoor settings and where they talk loudly, shout, breathe heavily or sing such as restaurants, choir practices, fitness classes, nightclubs, offices and places of worship.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19) > Wear a mask properly > p[122]", "sha256_of_page": "f8a274d7c5e37c6c7cd3a7644696c426a3b9cea772dde4a3f7f9aad7548a2f71", "sha256_of_paragraph": "d253f751cbd3e083decf25a2fb69243872ca64d5710963a65919f5c80c7e6f20", "source_id": "WHO-PUB", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public"}
{"char_offset": [6665, 6710], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:35Z", "heading_path": ["Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19)", "Wear a mask properly"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 123, "paragraph_text": "To make your environment as safe as possible:", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19) > Wear a mask properly > p[123]", "sha256_of_page": "f8a274d7c5e37c6c7cd3a7644696c426a3b9cea772dde4a3f7f9aad7548a2f71", "sha256_of_paragraph": "d27351c67cfffcd697599e7d9e8d83323d58c3cf5b2554f427ffa9095058b538", "source_id": "WHO-PUB", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public"}
{"char_offset": [6711, 6783], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:35Z", "heading_path": ["Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19)", "Wear a mask properly"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 124, "paragraph_text": "Avoid the 3Cs: spaces that are closed, crowded or involve close contact.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19) > Wear a mask properly > p[124]", "sha256_of_page": "f8a274d7c5e37c6c7cd3a7644696c426a3b9cea772dde4a3f7f9aad7548a2f71", "sha256_of_paragraph": "edb5989d87cab1f46b217431a42791b5df5a07cb5b067a4596c6862f4c63286d", "source_id": "WHO-PUB", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public"}
{"char_offset": [6784, 6926], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:35Z", "heading_path": ["Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19)", "Wear a mask properly"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 125, "paragraph_text": "Meet people outside. Outdoor gatherings are safer than indoor ones, particularly if indoor spaces are small and without outdoor air coming in.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19) > Wear a mask properly > p[125]", "sha256_of_page": "f8a274d7c5e37c6c7cd3a7644696c426a3b9cea772dde4a3f7f9aad7548a2f71", "sha256_of_paragraph": "3e1d41cd2fcb212ec7c6af3cb096d30c7401fe37674bfce3ec4a90b430a54bfd", "source_id": "WHO-PUB", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public"}
{"char_offset": [6927, 6997], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:35Z", "heading_path": ["Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19)", "Wear a mask properly"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 126, "paragraph_text": "If you can’t avoid crowded or indoor settings, take these precautions:", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19) > Wear a mask properly > p[126]", "sha256_of_page": "f8a274d7c5e37c6c7cd3a7644696c426a3b9cea772dde4a3f7f9aad7548a2f71", "sha256_of_paragraph": "239e55aee6cd42039121454e7e631f69431d0cfedb6eca5e86aa3c1b0906656a", "source_id": "WHO-PUB", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public"}
{"char_offset": [6998, 7071], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:35Z", "heading_path": ["Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19)", "Wear a mask properly"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 127, "paragraph_text": "Open a window to increase the amount of natural ventilation when indoors.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19) > Wear a mask properly > p[127]", "sha256_of_page": "f8a274d7c5e37c6c7cd3a7644696c426a3b9cea772dde4a3f7f9aad7548a2f71", "sha256_of_paragraph": "7ec10e5054a0da1a7b1d2f1f59baa0810ed164348e373efd143e3305915aba54", "source_id": "WHO-PUB", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public"}
{"char_offset": [7072, 7113], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:35Z", "heading_path": ["Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19)", "Wear a mask properly"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 128, "paragraph_text": "Wear a mask (see above for more details).", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19) > Wear a mask properly > p[128]", "sha256_of_page": "f8a274d7c5e37c6c7cd3a7644696c426a3b9cea772dde4a3f7f9aad7548a2f71", "sha256_of_paragraph": "735aa0820ad3c122552700cb186ac997b3e90ff6c48314abfa08a18dab3a270a", "source_id": "WHO-PUB", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public"}
{"char_offset": [7114, 7171], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:35Z", "heading_path": ["Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19)", "Wear a mask properly"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 129, "paragraph_text": "Ventilation and air conditioning (for the general public)", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19) > Wear a mask properly > p[129]", "sha256_of_page": "f8a274d7c5e37c6c7cd3a7644696c426a3b9cea772dde4a3f7f9aad7548a2f71", "sha256_of_paragraph": "2ab8357d1cedb3b23f138cf47cd7ec9ce1e2c7ad09f9e5500f87b82beee0c7b8", "source_id": "WHO-PUB", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public"}
{"char_offset": [7172, 7256], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:35Z", "heading_path": ["Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19)", "Wear a mask properly"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 130, "paragraph_text": "Ventilation and air conditioning (for people who manage public spaces and buildings)", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19) > Wear a mask properly > p[130]", "sha256_of_page": "f8a274d7c5e37c6c7cd3a7644696c426a3b9cea772dde4a3f7f9aad7548a2f71", "sha256_of_paragraph": "85d5c4016a80b10450c757328e1c77db4cb6d290dcf5e7fb183cab6d6aac437f", "source_id": "WHO-PUB", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public"}
{"char_offset": [7257, 7377], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:35Z", "heading_path": ["Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19)", "Wear a mask properly"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 131, "paragraph_text": "By following good respiratory hygiene you protect the people around you from viruses that cause colds, flu and COVID-19.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19) > Wear a mask properly > p[131]", "sha256_of_page": "f8a274d7c5e37c6c7cd3a7644696c426a3b9cea772dde4a3f7f9aad7548a2f71", "sha256_of_paragraph": "ba3fc7d8d7b2f5fff27c819b3ae7d46d7912c0fc0962187f78867067322b36ab", "source_id": "WHO-PUB", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public"}
{"char_offset": [7378, 7412], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:35Z", "heading_path": ["Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19)", "Wear a mask properly"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 132, "paragraph_text": "To ensure good hygiene you should:", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19) > Wear a mask properly > p[132]", "sha256_of_page": "f8a274d7c5e37c6c7cd3a7644696c426a3b9cea772dde4a3f7f9aad7548a2f71", "sha256_of_paragraph": "03011807d8453f5fc996379b0a893922997a1b6e3c449c20819d036fd686429a", "source_id": "WHO-PUB", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public"}
{"char_offset": [7413, 7579], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:35Z", "heading_path": ["Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19)", "Wear a mask properly"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 133, "paragraph_text": "Regularly and thoroughly clean your hands with either an alcohol-based hand rub or soap and water. This eliminates germs that may be on your hands, including viruses.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19) > Wear a mask properly > p[133]", "sha256_of_page": "f8a274d7c5e37c6c7cd3a7644696c426a3b9cea772dde4a3f7f9aad7548a2f71", "sha256_of_paragraph": "d45e3c5c6ae9f3aa37eec4a16007246e0902ee7b85db51f5f0a7f19fe08152a9", "source_id": "WHO-PUB", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public"}
{"char_offset": [7580, 7742], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:35Z", "heading_path": ["Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19)", "Wear a mask properly"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 134, "paragraph_text": "Cover your mouth and nose with your bent elbow or a tissue when you cough or sneeze. Dispose of the used tissue immediately into a closed bin and wash your hands.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19) > Wear a mask properly > p[134]", "sha256_of_page": "f8a274d7c5e37c6c7cd3a7644696c426a3b9cea772dde4a3f7f9aad7548a2f71", "sha256_of_paragraph": "7992b11115c845b8bae998ec97017d0887165258665747d60a7c880d02e89c4f", "source_id": "WHO-PUB", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public"}
{"char_offset": [7743, 7878], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:35Z", "heading_path": ["Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19)", "Wear a mask properly"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 135, "paragraph_text": "Clean and disinfect surfaces frequently, especially those which are regularly touched, such as door handles, faucets and phone screens.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19) > Wear a mask properly > p[135]", "sha256_of_page": "f8a274d7c5e37c6c7cd3a7644696c426a3b9cea772dde4a3f7f9aad7548a2f71", "sha256_of_paragraph": "b5ecb0d0214de30c8232597708d61eea12b5d114977221d70d4aae92079c7bdd", "source_id": "WHO-PUB", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public"}
{"char_offset": [7879, 7917], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:35Z", "heading_path": ["Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19)", "Wear a mask properly"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 136, "paragraph_text": "If you feel unwell, here’s what to do.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19) > Wear a mask properly > p[136]", "sha256_of_page": "f8a274d7c5e37c6c7cd3a7644696c426a3b9cea772dde4a3f7f9aad7548a2f71", "sha256_of_paragraph": "c379e6c9cb524ae4501b5265ea20eee1d8f395a5f75c01aaf6206aa6ea6d50b7", "source_id": "WHO-PUB", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public"}
{"char_offset": [7918, 8088], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:35Z", "heading_path": ["Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19)", "Wear a mask properly"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 137, "paragraph_text": "If you have a fever, cough and difficulty breathing, seek medical attention immediately. Call by telephone first and follow the directions of your local health authority.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19) > Wear a mask properly > p[137]", "sha256_of_page": "f8a274d7c5e37c6c7cd3a7644696c426a3b9cea772dde4a3f7f9aad7548a2f71", "sha256_of_paragraph": "5b92bff67a22a21fbadc3beab9608164cbbfb26aaaaa2383d4af795b2a73a127", "source_id": "WHO-PUB", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public"}
{"char_offset": [8089, 8383], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:35Z", "heading_path": ["Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19)", "Wear a mask properly"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 138, "paragraph_text": "Know the full range of symptoms of COVID-19. The most common symptoms of COVID-19 are fever, dry cough, tiredness and loss of taste or smell. Less common symptoms include aches and pains, headache, sore throat, red or irritated eyes, diarrhoea, a skin rash or discolouration of fingers or toes.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19) > Wear a mask properly > p[138]", "sha256_of_page": "f8a274d7c5e37c6c7cd3a7644696c426a3b9cea772dde4a3f7f9aad7548a2f71", "sha256_of_paragraph": "58f76c511d4d3dcd352c20054ff33fde9b0e1f67ba1af31e5c4bdc47e93c120a", "source_id": "WHO-PUB", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public"}
{"char_offset": [8384, 8680], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:35Z", "heading_path": ["Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19)", "Wear a mask properly"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 139, "paragraph_text": "Stay home and self-isolate for 10 days from symptom onset, plus three days after symptoms cease. Call your health care provider or hotline for advice. Have someone bring you supplies. If you need to leave your house or have someone near you, wear a properly fitted mask to avoid infecting others.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19) > Wear a mask properly > p[139]", "sha256_of_page": "f8a274d7c5e37c6c7cd3a7644696c426a3b9cea772dde4a3f7f9aad7548a2f71", "sha256_of_paragraph": "ddfc7fdd17dc2817d13ce042f896f787bbe546fa4e8c9873cfda50fdd2a49eb7", "source_id": "WHO-PUB", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public"}
{"char_offset": [8681, 8951], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:48:35Z", "heading_path": ["Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19)", "Wear a mask properly"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 140, "paragraph_text": "Keep up to date on the latest information from trusted sources, such as WHO or your local and national health authorities. Local and national authorities and public health units are best placed to advise on what people in your area should be doing to protect themselves.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Advice for the public: Coronavirus disease (COVID-19) > Wear a mask properly > p[140]", "sha256_of_page": "f8a274d7c5e37c6c7cd3a7644696c426a3b9cea772dde4a3f7f9aad7548a2f71", "sha256_of_paragraph": "b931566f53352a9f8a9c697366e287615194f8c6ff8010f6e4b91c2ae7cdbcab", "source_id": "WHO-PUB", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public"}
