{"char_offset": [19033, 19178], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:53:49Z", "heading_path": ["Cooking with Microwave Ovens", "How should you clean the inside of a microwave oven?", "For More Information"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "archived_copy", "paragraph_index": 147, "paragraph_text": "Contact the International Microwave Power Institute, P.O. Box 1140, Mechanicsville, VA 23111, (804) 559-6667, email: info@impi.org, www.impi.org.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Cooking with Microwave Ovens > How should you clean the inside of a microwave oven? > For More Information > p[147]", "sha256_of_page": "a3010e76a59170a0f610de828fd54011639e828730bad77e6f455bb1c995d19f", "sha256_of_paragraph": "5b25c04c113cbe27e9b69b99e2f115e1ba1adbf52a2f5b4858c3d0e8f64395ff", "source_id": "USDA-MW", "tag": "p", "url": "http://web.archive.org/web/20261119141358/https://www.fsis.usda.gov/food-safety/safe-food-handling-and-preparation/food-safety-basics/cooking-microwave-ovens"}
{"char_offset": [19179, 19300], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:53:49Z", "heading_path": ["Cooking with Microwave Ovens", "How should you clean the inside of a microwave oven?", "Slow Cookers and Food Safety"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "archived_copy", "paragraph_index": 148, "paragraph_text": "At any time of year, a slow cooker can make life a little more convenient because by planning ahead, you save time later.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Cooking with Microwave Ovens > How should you clean the inside of a microwave oven? > Slow Cookers and Food Safety > p[148]", "sha256_of_page": "a3010e76a59170a0f610de828fd54011639e828730bad77e6f455bb1c995d19f", "sha256_of_paragraph": "ad2efa9fbb90a2fecbe6a861a85dec3bbc5ceffee44d06a54948a9e50e6f6f5e", "source_id": "USDA-MW", "tag": "p", "url": "http://web.archive.org/web/20261119141358/https://www.fsis.usda.gov/food-safety/safe-food-handling-and-preparation/food-safety-basics/cooking-microwave-ovens"}
{"char_offset": [19301, 19468], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:53:49Z", "heading_path": ["Cooking with Microwave Ovens", "How should you clean the inside of a microwave oven?", "Cleanliness Helps Prevent Foodborne Illness"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "archived_copy", "paragraph_index": 149, "paragraph_text": "Cleanliness is a major factor in preventing foodborne illness. Washing hands with warm water and soap for at least 20 seconds can help eliminate germs from your hands.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Cooking with Microwave Ovens > How should you clean the inside of a microwave oven? > Cleanliness Helps Prevent Foodborne Illness > p[149]", "sha256_of_page": "a3010e76a59170a0f610de828fd54011639e828730bad77e6f455bb1c995d19f", "sha256_of_paragraph": "1d05658ce06d35e19d14e57a2f33c575649f55aaaa10769509ec085a32a4ff45", "source_id": "USDA-MW", "tag": "p", "url": "http://web.archive.org/web/20261119141358/https://www.fsis.usda.gov/food-safety/safe-food-handling-and-preparation/food-safety-basics/cooking-microwave-ovens"}
{"char_offset": [19469, 19587], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:53:49Z", "heading_path": ["Cooking with Microwave Ovens", "How should you clean the inside of a microwave oven?", "Leftovers and Food Safety"], "language": "en", "page_nature": "archived_copy", "paragraph_index": 150, "paragraph_text": "Handle leftovers with care: make sure the food is cooked to a safe temperature and refrigerate any leftovers promptly.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Cooking with Microwave Ovens > How should you clean the inside of a microwave oven? > Leftovers and Food Safety > p[150]", "sha256_of_page": "a3010e76a59170a0f610de828fd54011639e828730bad77e6f455bb1c995d19f", "sha256_of_paragraph": "a012319aae77d0bed3ffcc1579ad84e360c486f65945bd76863a57669204517a", "source_id": "USDA-MW", "tag": "p", "url": "http://web.archive.org/web/20261119141358/https://www.fsis.usda.gov/food-safety/safe-food-handling-and-preparation/food-safety-basics/cooking-microwave-ovens"}
