{"char_offset": [419, 500], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:50:12Z", "heading_path": ["Adult Activity: An Overview", "Key points"], "language": "en-us", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 6, "paragraph_text": "Physical activity is one of the most important things you can do for your health.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Adult Activity: An Overview > Key points > p[6]", "sha256_of_page": "cf4d1369d269c4a962f888cf08343f7c81834b513c368cb6d25e838b337827e2", "sha256_of_paragraph": "a1a5675db05904f9fa3bc092c340424e326064439e5dceb0829cf28ef8647854", "source_id": "CDC-PA-ADULT", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.cdc.gov/physical-activity-basics/guidelines/adults.html"}
{"char_offset": [501, 622], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:50:12Z", "heading_path": ["Adult Activity: An Overview", "Key points"], "language": "en-us", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 7, "paragraph_text": "Adults need at least 150 minutes of moderate-intensity physical activity a week, such as 30 minutes a day, 5 days a week.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Adult Activity: An Overview > Key points > p[7]", "sha256_of_page": "cf4d1369d269c4a962f888cf08343f7c81834b513c368cb6d25e838b337827e2", "sha256_of_paragraph": "f9b816a4faa934990ca9b0ecc2a9ba369051d571dbb5ca02fb9093b53376daa4", "source_id": "CDC-PA-ADULT", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.cdc.gov/physical-activity-basics/guidelines/adults.html"}
{"char_offset": [623, 690], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:50:12Z", "heading_path": ["Adult Activity: An Overview", "Key points"], "language": "en-us", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 8, "paragraph_text": "Adults also need 2 days of muscle-strengthening activity each week.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Adult Activity: An Overview > Key points > p[8]", "sha256_of_page": "cf4d1369d269c4a962f888cf08343f7c81834b513c368cb6d25e838b337827e2", "sha256_of_paragraph": "53db8415259dd41a69b4578e0844a5f71698d426d6713631703443676c63c27b", "source_id": "CDC-PA-ADULT", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.cdc.gov/physical-activity-basics/guidelines/adults.html"}
{"char_offset": [691, 906], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:50:12Z", "heading_path": ["Adult Activity: An Overview", "Recommendations for adults"], "language": "en-us", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 9, "paragraph_text": "Physical activity is anything that gets your body moving. Physical activity supports physical and mental health. The benefits of physical activity make it one of the most important things you can do for your health.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Adult Activity: An Overview > Recommendations for adults > p[9]", "sha256_of_page": "cf4d1369d269c4a962f888cf08343f7c81834b513c368cb6d25e838b337827e2", "sha256_of_paragraph": "c4e72ac5419be2b775f83d2e89898b820204c258fe0bb47d7e51290eba27d02c", "source_id": "CDC-PA-ADULT", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.cdc.gov/physical-activity-basics/guidelines/adults.html"}
{"char_offset": [907, 1266], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:50:12Z", "heading_path": ["Adult Activity: An Overview", "Recommendations for adults"], "language": "en-us", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 10, "paragraph_text": "According to the current Physical Activity Guidelines for Americans, adults need 150 minutes of moderate-intensity physical activity a week. This can also be 75 minutes of vigorous-intensity or an equivalent combination of moderate- and vigorous-intensity physical activity. In addition, adults need at least 2 days of muscle-strengthening activity each week.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Adult Activity: An Overview > Recommendations for adults > p[10]", "sha256_of_page": "cf4d1369d269c4a962f888cf08343f7c81834b513c368cb6d25e838b337827e2", "sha256_of_paragraph": "eda6c91b47ce028c7ea528d1bba30cfb2ac7f7757b1991deb4efd9601cc59c2e", "source_id": "CDC-PA-ADULT", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.cdc.gov/physical-activity-basics/guidelines/adults.html"}
{"char_offset": [1267, 1547], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:50:12Z", "heading_path": ["Adult Activity: An Overview", "Recommendations for adults"], "language": "en-us", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 11, "paragraph_text": "We know 150 minutes of physical activity each week sounds like a lot, but you don't have to do it all at once. It could be 30 minutes a day, 5 days a week. You can spread your activity out during the week and break it up into smaller chunks of time. See steps for getting started.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Adult Activity: An Overview > Recommendations for adults > p[11]", "sha256_of_page": "cf4d1369d269c4a962f888cf08343f7c81834b513c368cb6d25e838b337827e2", "sha256_of_paragraph": "29910cf455c5cbbd206e4c9f475e2cb0557e05a52b84f0b6b3bb838aa27c4bf8", "source_id": "CDC-PA-ADULT", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.cdc.gov/physical-activity-basics/guidelines/adults.html"}
{"char_offset": [1548, 1750], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:50:12Z", "heading_path": ["Adult Activity: An Overview", "Recommendations for adults", "Move more, sit less."], "language": "en-us", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 12, "paragraph_text": "Some physical activity is better than none. Adults who sit less and do any amount of moderate- or vigorous-intensity physical activity gain some health benefits. Learn more about what counts for adults.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Adult Activity: An Overview > Recommendations for adults > Move more, sit less. > p[12]", "sha256_of_page": "cf4d1369d269c4a962f888cf08343f7c81834b513c368cb6d25e838b337827e2", "sha256_of_paragraph": "a6e62bb0518ab77a0550b471289dd5aaa4322a9462c3e198a2b2dfd1f770566e", "source_id": "CDC-PA-ADULT", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.cdc.gov/physical-activity-basics/guidelines/adults.html"}
{"char_offset": [1751, 1885], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:50:12Z", "heading_path": ["Adult Activity: An Overview", "Recommendations for adults", "Recommended levels for health benefits"], "language": "en-us", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 13, "paragraph_text": "Moderate-intensity aerobic activity (such as brisk walking) for 150 minutes every week (for example, 30 minutes a day, 5 days a week).", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Adult Activity: An Overview > Recommendations for adults > Recommended levels for health benefits > p[13]", "sha256_of_page": "cf4d1369d269c4a962f888cf08343f7c81834b513c368cb6d25e838b337827e2", "sha256_of_paragraph": "e71ae7fb9c252741b2f16666e17fda42d12a8b7ee0faad78594e416f2a522ffa", "source_id": "CDC-PA-ADULT", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.cdc.gov/physical-activity-basics/guidelines/adults.html"}
{"char_offset": [1886, 2033], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:50:12Z", "heading_path": ["Adult Activity: An Overview", "Recommendations for adults", "Recommended levels for health benefits"], "language": "en-us", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 14, "paragraph_text": "Muscle-strengthening activities on 2 or more days a week that work all major muscle groups (legs, hips, back, abdomen, chest, shoulders, and arms).", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Adult Activity: An Overview > Recommendations for adults > Recommended levels for health benefits > p[14]", "sha256_of_page": "cf4d1369d269c4a962f888cf08343f7c81834b513c368cb6d25e838b337827e2", "sha256_of_paragraph": "ecebd3a05081c15104c035de2e9b3b3636b5a535c1b6ebdd34ef92faa669f357", "source_id": "CDC-PA-ADULT", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.cdc.gov/physical-activity-basics/guidelines/adults.html"}
{"char_offset": [2034, 2149], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:50:12Z", "heading_path": ["Adult Activity: An Overview", "Recommendations for adults", "Recommended levels for health benefits"], "language": "en-us", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 15, "paragraph_text": "Vigorous-intensity aerobic activity (such as jogging or running) for 75 minutes (1 hour and 15 minutes) every week.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Adult Activity: An Overview > Recommendations for adults > Recommended levels for health benefits > p[15]", "sha256_of_page": "cf4d1369d269c4a962f888cf08343f7c81834b513c368cb6d25e838b337827e2", "sha256_of_paragraph": "bf2c86cb5920ff172782a5f308a28ae400fbbe782676bce9eb5c0760db0ca5d4", "source_id": "CDC-PA-ADULT", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.cdc.gov/physical-activity-basics/guidelines/adults.html"}
{"char_offset": [2150, 2246], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:50:12Z", "heading_path": ["Adult Activity: An Overview", "Recommendations for adults", "Recommended levels for health benefits"], "language": "en-us", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 16, "paragraph_text": "An equivalent mix of moderate- and vigorous-intensity aerobic activity on 2 or more days a week.", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "Adult Activity: An Overview > Recommendations for adults > Recommended levels for health benefits > p[16]", "sha256_of_page": "cf4d1369d269c4a962f888cf08343f7c81834b513c368cb6d25e838b337827e2", "sha256_of_paragraph": "e1157a18544febb8f33b14bc6c83c21be2b55bfc0f0e395f178b32d78cb1d45b", "source_id": "CDC-PA-ADULT", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.cdc.gov/physical-activity-basics/guidelines/adults.html"}
