{"char_offset": [1235, 1334], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T12:50:29Z", "heading_path": ["About Measles", "Signs and symptoms"], "language": "en-us", "page_nature": "live", "paragraph_index": 13, "paragraph_text": "Measles symptoms appear 7 to 14 days after contact with the virus. Common measles symptoms include:", "published_or_updated": "", "selector": "About Measles > Signs and symptoms > p[13]", "sha256_of_page": "84a0c818aaaa7eaaff12f24e4ac658513097170bd019ebfe5277c3483df53747", "sha256_of_paragraph": "ebdbc8d01cb2ab5bcf6f15335ab19a9c528dd05985dedf196a44073acfafb860", "source_id": "CDC-MEASLES-VAX", "tag": "p", "url": "https://www.cdc.gov/measles/about/"}
